 PARITY MAPPING (web source is THE spec)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Web component is a PURE PRESENTATIONAL widget-chrome shell (no data source / no hooks). Every
  render branch is reproduced 1:1:
    web if (loading) <Skeleton h-full rounded-xl/>     -> WidgetShellState.loading -> TSSkeleton (full-bleed, GeometryReader, radius lg)
    web if (error) <QueryError/>                       -> WidgetShellState.error  -> TSQueryError(onRetry:) / TSErrorDisplay (centered, p-4)
    web title ? header : overlay                       -> WidgetShellLayout.showsTitleHeader(title:)
    web header: icon + title(uppercase tracking) + help-> titledHeader: icon()+Text(label, .textCase(.uppercase) kerning) + WidgetShellHelpButton
    web header right: freshness + pin + actions        -> WidgetShellFreshnessChip(compact:false) + WidgetShellPinButton + actions()
    web title-less overlay freshness (top-1.5 right-1.5)-> ZStack(topTrailing) overlay chip, compact = true
    web DataFreshness 4-state (fresh/fetching/stale/err)-> WidgetShellFreshnessStatus.resolve (error>fetching>stale>fresh); SF wifi/refresh/wifi/wifi.slash; tones success/info/warning/danger
    web formatRelativeTime (<60s..weeks)               -> WidgetShellRelativeTimeBucket.bucket + P1/S10 freshness.justNow/minutes/hours/days/weeks
    web relativeTime ternary (updating/error/'')       -> WidgetShellFreshnessLabel.resolve
    web justUpdated 1.5s green glow on updatedAt change -> WidgetShellPulse.shouldPulse + .shadow(statusSuccess .15) animation (Reduce-Motion safe)
    web !noPadding ? 'px-4 pb-3' : ''                  -> bodyInsets (lg/​md) vs EdgeInsets()
    web HelpTooltip (text/i18nKey/defaultValue/learnMore)-> WidgetShellHelpButton (resolvedText facade + Link)
    web PinButton (pin/unpin, aria-pressed)            -> WidgetShellPinButton (pin / pin.slash, .isSelected trait)
  Shared components used by web -> native counterparts:
    @/components/feedback  Skeleton / QueryError  -> TSSkeleton / TSQueryError / TSErrorDisplay (real shared components)
    @/components/ui        HelpTooltip / PinButton-> WidgetShellHelpButton / WidgetShellPinButton (TSHelpTooltip cannot carry WidgetHelp.learnMore; no shared TSPinButton — built faithfully, view-only, host owns persistence)
    @/components/data-display DataFreshness        -> WidgetShellFreshnessChip (no shared 4-state chip; TSFreshnessIndicator is the per-datum web FreshnessIndicator, a different component)
  Charts/maps: none in this primitive.
  i18n: web WidgetShell is anonymous; the strings it renders come from the composed chrome
